          {
            "title": "Sorting strings",
            "id": 82516,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat menggunakan <code>sort()</code> pada list string seperti <code>names</code>, elemen-elemennya diurutkan berdasarkan urutan alfabet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cloe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"names.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(names)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ana', 'Bill', 'Cloe']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>names</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>sort</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82615,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instruksi mana yang mengurutkan nilai dalam list?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>max()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>sort()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai dalam <code>scores</code> tidak berurutan. Instruksi mana yang mengurutkan list tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scores.sort()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>max(scores)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores.append()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>scores.sort()</code>.</p></body></html>"
