            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana <code>sort()</code> mengurutkan list string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dalam urutan alfabet</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita hanya bisa menggunakan <code>sort()</code> pada list yang berisi angka</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dalam urutan alfabet.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa isi <code>[\"pear\", \"apple\", \"banana\"]</code> setelah <code>sort()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"apple\", \"banana\", \"pear\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"pear\", \"banana\", \"apple\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Terjadi error karena <code>sort()</code> hanya dapat digunakan untuk angka.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"apple\", \"banana\", \"pear\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82621,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketikan <code>active_users</code>, titik <code>.</code>, dan <code>sort()</code> untuk mengurutkan jumlah pengguna mingguan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"active_users.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(active_users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[103, 140, 200, 288]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>active_users</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>sort</code>, <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Urutkan jumlah pengguna mingguan dalam <code>active_users</code> dari terendah hingga tertinggi agar menampilkan <code>[103, 140, 200, 288]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"active_users = [\" /><text value=\"103\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"140\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"288\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"active_users.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(active_users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"order\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sorted\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[103, 140, 200, 288]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>active_users</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, <code>sort</code>, dan terakhir <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Display",
            "id": 82625,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>sold_tickets</code>, urutkan list tersebut, lalu tampilkan lagi untuk melihat perbedaannya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sold_tickets = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sold_tickets.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[7, 20, 12, 30]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[7, 12, 20, 30]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>sold_tickets.sort()</code>, dan terakhir <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode mencetak <code>[7, 20, 12, 30]</code>, lalu <code>[7, 12, 20, 30]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sold_tickets = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sold_tickets.sort()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sold_tickets)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sold_tickets.pop()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[7, 20, 12, 30]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[7, 12, 20, 30]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>sold_tickets.sort()</code>, dan terakhir <code>print(sold_tickets)</code>.</p></body></html>",
